  "contentHtml": "<div><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); border-image: none; background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다. </span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><b><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 11pt;\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요. </span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</span></span></b></p></div><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/999A063359D8C8BE36\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"125\" height=\"95\" style=\"width: 125px; height: 95px; clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"KakaoTalk_20171007_204105454.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"960\"  id=\"A_999A063359D8C8BE368CF8\"/></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">달의모양변화 과정평가 수업자료입니다. </p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">평소 수업 준비할 때 재과만에서 좋은 자료 받아서 활용해 왔습니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">항상 고맙습니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHv%26dataid%3D1117%26fileid%3D2%26regdt%3D20171007213535&url=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile285.uf.daum.net%2Fattach%2F9918303359D8C9C029EE54')\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/daumtop_deco/icon/icon.hanmail.net/editor/p_etc_s.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"첨부파일\" class=\"vam\"/> 1달-수행평가방법.pptx</a></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHv%26dataid%3D1117%26fileid%3D3%26regdt%3D20171007213535&url=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile276.uf.daum.net%2Fattach%2F993C323359D8C9EE08D4F0')\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/daumtop_deco/icon/icon.hanmail.net/editor/p_etc_s.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"첨부파일\" class=\"vam\"/> 달의 모양변화ppt.ppt</a></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHv%26dataid%3D1117%26fileid%3D4%26regdt%3D20171007213535&url=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile257.uf.daum.net%2Fattach%2F993BDB3359D8C9FD27A4A8')\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/daumtop_deco/icon/icon.hanmail.net/editor/p_etc_s.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"첨부파일\" class=\"vam\"/> 활동지5-1보고서 수행평가(달-시험지).hwp</a></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHv%26dataid%3D1117%26fileid%3D5%26regdt%3D20171007213535&url=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile246.uf.daum.net%2Fattach%2F9944DB3359D8CA09077B15')\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/daumtop_deco/icon/icon.hanmail.net/editor/p_etc_s.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"첨부파일\" class=\"vam\"/> 활동지5-2보고서 수행평가(달-연습용).hwp</a></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br></p><p><br></p></div><p><br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
